  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low Emissions Development Planning for Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supports the establishment of international, national and sub-national frameworks for low emission development. This includes building capacity to create or improve low emissions energy development strategies; improving data and analytical tools for low emission energy planning; and building or improving monitoring, reporting, and verification systems.</narrative>
  </description>
